{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new type of bullet hell action game is born! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the moment when a barrage of shouts is deflected with a shield, overturning the conventional wisdom of bullet hell games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and diverse mecha (weapons). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim 360 degrees with the right stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block the attacks of powerful enemies with your shield and counterattack when you see an opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place in beautiful night-time cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle begins with memorable soundtracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Compatible with Xbox controllers and PC controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a PS5 controller, PS4 controller, or Switch Pro controller, you can play by using a free tool called DS4Windows.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3128270?t=1759331386","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3128270?t=1759331386","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128270/ccf76ef56de0b846597f690c36965e528dfab1fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759331386","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128270/ccf76ef56de0b846597f690c36965e528dfab1fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759331386","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new type of bullet hell action game is born! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the moment when a barrage of shouts is deflected with a shield, overturning the conventional wisdom of bullet hell games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and diverse mecha (weapons). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim 360 degrees with the right stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block the attacks of powerful enemies with your shield and counterattack when you see an opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place in beautiful night-time cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle begins with memorable soundtracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Compatible with Xbox controllers and PC controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a PS5 controller, PS4 controller, or Switch Pro controller, you can play by using a free tool called DS4Windows.</p>","developers":["YUMEYUME"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128270/c242f4faaaafd890eb0f13db86bb1c0e152a3639/header.jpg?t=1759331386","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3128270/123092046/45175a172cb46ced96ca38da512b2e829492e8ee/1759324464/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759325927","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3128270/123092046/45175a172cb46ced96ca38da512b2e829492e8ee/1759324464/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759325927","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3128270/123092046/45175a172cb46ced96ca38da512b2e829492e8ee/1759324464/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759325927","id":257210023,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210023/movie480.mp4?t=1759325927","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210023/movie_max.mp4?t=1759325927"},"name":"Light Night Street Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210023/3d980e4768de0189fcc41106f9fc19d3b9e14fe0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759325927","webm":{"480":"h